1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:11,640
Welcome to Ghost Signal! We're so glad you're here. Let's get you set up and move your show over to Art nineteen — that's the platform Ghost Signal hosts on.

2
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:24,614
The whole switch is four little steps. Nothing here is hard — it just takes a bit of time. Plan on about two hours of your time, spread out, plus a day or two while we import and the apps catch up.

3
00:00:25,664 --> 00:00:31,280
You can tick those off right here in your browser, at ghostsignal.cloud slash studio slash migration.

4
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:36,322
Now let's get you set up.

5
00:00:37,272 --> 00:00:55,920
First, before we move a thing — grab your analytics from wherever you are now. Those numbers don't come with you, so download them while you still can. If you've been running dynamic ads, switch them off so they don't get baked into the move. And jot down every place your player is embedded — website, newsletter, all of it. We'll swap those later.

6
00:00:57,570 --> 00:01:12,882
Okay, keys. Send us your RSS feed URL. We'll import the show and invite you into Art nineteen. When it lands, just poke around your episodes and make sure the notes and numbering look right. If you had dynamic ads, we'll bulk-import those insertion points too.

7
00:01:14,332 --> 00:01:30,028
This next one's the big one, but it's still just a few clicks. Make sure every episode is actually there, set your profile to Active, and on your old host put a permanent 301 redirect to the new Art nineteen feed. Do that a few days before your next episode so you're not racing a deadline.

8
00:01:31,678 --> 00:01:46,534
Opening day! Give Apple and Spotify up to a day to notice the new address. Swap those old embed players for the Art nineteen ones. And only when everything feels good — then you cancel the old host. Not before. We don't want any surprises.

9
00:01:47,984 --> 00:01:54,872
Once you're moved in, publishing is three screens. I'll show you exactly where to click — these are the real pages.

10
00:01:55,722 --> 00:02:01,530
You're on Content. See that button up in the top right? That's New Episode. Click it.

11
00:02:02,780 --> 00:02:10,844
Drop your audio on that big upload area, or hit Select File. Give the episode a title, fill in whatever you need, and Save is up top.

12
00:02:12,094 --> 00:02:22,870
Last screen — ads. We already drop in the pre-roll and post-roll for you. You just place two mid-rolls at a natural break, two minutes each. Six markers total, and you're done.

13
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:30,992
That's it! If you run into anything, email us — we personally help with whatever problem you have. Welcome home.
